# CSV writes

Before a production write, copy the live file to `backups/` with a timestamp (under `Custom Label Database/`).

If `PermissionError` (CSV open in Excel/Cursor): write `Custom_Label_Database_write_fallback.csv`, tell the supervisor to close the live file, then swap. Do not leave two competing live CSVs.

PE CSV encoding: try `utf-8`, `utf-8-sig`, `cp1252`, `latin-1` (byte `0xB2` is not valid UTF-8).
